---
description: Fuse architecture and backend rules
globs: apps/api/**,apps/runner/**,packages/**,infra/**
alwaysApply: true
---

Use TypeScript, AWS SDK v3, Amazon Bedrock Converse API with tool use, Lambda, API
Gateway HTTP API, DynamoDB, EventBridge, and CloudWatch. All model and tool calls
must pass through beforeCall. A denied call must not execute the underlying call.

Use typed contracts for Policy, Run, Event, BeforeCallInput, and PolicyDecision.
Preserve immutable original runs during replay. Use idempotency keys for run
creation and conditional writes for event ordering.

Fail closed when the policy decision or required audit write cannot be trusted.
Label all cost values as estimates. Choose CDK or SAM, never both.
